DTSTART:20260618T221500Z
DTEND:20260618T234500Z
DTSTAMP:20260618T000000Z
SUMMARY:RuWriting History: The Social Impact of RuPaul's Drag Race NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nRuPaul's Drag Race revolutionized the way drag is consumed\, 
 appreciated and sponsored in the 21st century. This illustrated talk and 
 discussion by drag historian Joe E. Jeffreys offers an in depth look into 
 the Emmy award winning international media franchise and how it has forever 
 impacted the art form of drag.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Conference Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School
UID:LibCal-10306-16482119
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16482119
