X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup North Jersey Bowling Soccer Volleyball": "https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball/events/314943553/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_north_jersey_bowling_soccer_volleyball
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_314943553@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260618T044621Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260621T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260621T120000
SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Sundays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nThe offic
 ial meetup times are 8 AM and 9 AM respectively. If no one confirms for 8 
 AM but at least one person confirms for 9 AM then we start at 9 AM instead
 . If you are seriously attending any one event then please confirm one or 
 the other start time in the comments so we can all coordinate and have an 
 idea of what the actual attendance will be. You can confirm your arrival t
 ime on another person's confirmation (for 8 or 9) by liking that comment. 
 Regardless of which official start time we use\, you are welcome to show u
 p any other time\, although we are not responsible if we happen to disband
  early for any reason. The 12 PM cut-off time is only a general placeholde
 r\, not a guarantee\, and we may all end sooner or later than that\, depen
 ding on various factors. Plan accordingly and please use the comments for 
 the benefit of our attendees as we try to please as many different time pr
 eferences as possible.\n\n**ABOUT THE GROUP:** We are typically beginner t
 o intermediate levels playing in a friendly\, sociable\, and supportive en
 vironment while not being shy to a little friendly competition. We may ral
 ly freely in the beginning to warm up and then move on to some quick-rotat
 ion matches between 5-7 points. No formal teams here so everyone should be
  ready to both play with and against everyone else who shows up.\n\n**EQUI
 PMENT:** Please be sure to bring your own racquet and water\, as we don’
 t provide those. Also\, I always have some balls for at least one court\, 
 but feel free to bring your own as well in case we need to branch out over
  more than one court.\n\n**DISCLAIMER:** Courts are subject to availabilit
 y and weather. If you make serious plans to attend then please be prepared
  to cancel or adjust our location as needed. Furthermore\, by attending yo
 u agree to be fully responsible for your own health and safety. Each perso
 n is responsible to take a break for rest and water at their own discretio
 n.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314943553/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260525T034240Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260525T034240Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Metrotrails": "https://www.meetup.com/metrotrails/events/315233426/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_metrotrails
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Metrotrails Hiking
UID:event_315233426@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260618T044620Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260621T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260622T180000
SUMMARY:Chesapeake and Ohio 2 Day Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for two days point to point hiking on the Chesapeake and Ohio Cana
 l and more!\nSunday we'll do between Brunswick and Monocacy Aqueduct\, and
  Monday we'll head downstream from Monocacy Aqueduct.\nAfter meeting Sunda
 y at 9 at the aqueduct\, we will shuttle with as few vehicles as possible 
 to the Holiday Inn.\nWe start right from the hotel\, and follow the Valley
  Trail system downhill through a pleasant gully to downtown Brunswick.\nHe
 re\, we'll cross the tracks and make our way onto the canal towpath to fol
 low it to Monocacy Creek.\nThe first day will feature lovely riverside sce
 nery\, historic canal locks\, and two major aqueducts. We'll take side tri
 ps to the river along the way.\nWe'll stay at the Holiday Inn\, then the s
 econd day\, we'll shuffle cars and hike between Monocacy Aqueduct and Syca
 more Landing.\nBoth places have little lunch stops along them if needed\, 
 but everyone should come prepared with plenty of water and food just in ca
 se.\nWith the exception of under a mile through scenic downtown Brunswick\
 , there is no road walking.\nThe first day has only 5 road access points\,
  and the second has only 4\, and not all of these are crossings.\nThis pro
 mises to be a beautiful\, relaxing two days along the canal and Potomac Ri
 ver.\nIf needed\, contact me at 908 343 8374
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/metrotrails/events/315233426/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260612T185345Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260612T185345Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
