DTEND:20260621T141500
UID:033e55b76b41ea62c6c1c2ef19153143@montclairfilm.org
DESCRIPTION:A shepherd reads detective novels to his beloved sheep every n
 ight\, assuming they can’t possibly understand. But when a mysterious in
 cident disrupts life on the farm\, the sheep realize they must become the 
