SUMMARY:CANCELLED - Learn English Book Club
DESCRIPTION:This class was cancelled and a make up class was held earlier 
 in the semester. Thank you!\n\n \n\n \n\nCome expand your English 
 vocabulary through great books! Learning another language also means using 
 that language. This is a great way to read\, discuss books and learn in a 
 safe friendly environment. Must be a second language learner (English is 
 not your first language) who is a fairly proficient speaker. If you’re 
 not sure but interested sign up and take a chance!\n\nOur first title will 
 be The Alchemist by Paulo Coelho. You can request a copy here or email 
 adultprograms@montclairlibrary.org with your library card number and we 
 will reserve a copy for you!\n\nThe group will not meet on Monday\, May 25 
 due to Memorial Day.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Tower Room
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult Services, Language, Book Club, ESL
UID:LibCal-10306-16695034
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16695034
END:VEVENT
