X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_cloud_data_driven
URL:https://www.meetup.com/cloud-data-driven/
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Cloud Data Driven
UID:event_315241879@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260618T044619Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260625T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260625T133000
SUMMARY:From OLTP to AI: Building a Modern Data Platform with Microsoft Fa
 bric
DESCRIPTION:Cloud Data Driven\nOperational databases such as MySQL and Pos
 tgreSQL power many applications\, but turning this data into analytics can
  require complex pipelines. Microsoft Fabric provides a unified platform f
 or data ingestion\, transformation\, and analytics.\n\nIn this talk\, we w
 ill explore how to move data from operational databases into a Fabric Lake
 house and build a scalable analytics platform. We will cover ingestion pat
 terns\, medallion architecture\, and practical lessons from building real 
 data pipelines.\n\nAttendees will learn how to design a simple and reliabl
 e architecture that connects transactional systems with modern analytics w
 orkflows.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/cloud-data-driven/events/315241879/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260613T121358Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260613T121358Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
