SUMMARY:CPR Training with Beat to Breathe CPR
DESCRIPTION:June is National CPR and AED Awareness Month! Come take a free 
 basic CPR training class with Div\, Andrea and Jada from Beat to Breathe 
 CPR.\n\n\nABOUT BEAT TO BREATHE CPR\n\nAs a registered 501(c)(3) 
 nonprofit\, Beat to Breathe CPR is dedicated to enhancing community health 
 and safety by providing affordable\, accessible CPR training to individuals 
 of all ages and backgrounds. Established in 2022\, we have remained 
 committed to empowering every student with life-saving skills and fostering 
 a community that is confident and prepared to respond effectively in 
 emergencies.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium
