DESCRIPTION:Join Outdoor Adventure for one of the most strenuous but spect
 acular hikes of the New Jersey and New York area. As we hike the Bearfort
  Mountain ridge past the Greenwood Lake\, rhododendron tunnel\, surprise 
 lake\, and west pond. Sure to be a breathtaking view the whole way up to 
 the summit of the mountain. \nHow do I sign-up?\n\nRegister online throug
 h Fusion\, in the Student Recreation Center main office\, or over the pho
 ne (973-655-3340).\nCost for Students $10\;  $20 Faculty/Staff\nRegistrat
 ion Opens on Fusion on Tuesday\, May 26\, 2026\n\nWhere and when?\n\nJune
  29\, 2026\n10:00am –5:00pm\nBegins at Student Recreation Center\n\nWhat 
 to bring: Water\, lunch\, weather appropriate clothing\, boots (sneakers 
 not acceptable)\, lunch\, snacks\, and sunscreen.\nPotential Hazards: Unp
 redictable weather changes\, sunburn/heat exhaustion\, dehydration\, alle
 rgic reactions/poisonous plants\, insect bites and injury by running\, in
 cluding sprains\, lacerations\, abrasions and fractures.\n\nHosted by: Ca
 mpus Recreation\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montcl
 air.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12474132
DTEND:20260629T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260618T044251Z
DTSTART:20260629T140000Z
LOCATION:Meet at the Student Recreation Center
