SUMMARY:Get To Know Your Sewing Machine
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nRemember that sewing machine in your closet? Free it\, and 
 spark your creativity!  Bring your own working sewing machine\, and you 
 will learn how to thread\, adjust tension\, operate and troubleshoot it 
 over the course of three weeks.  Project will be a custom letter garland 
 that you can create for any occasion or as a gift for someone 
 else!\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Students MUST bring their own sewing machine & 
 presser foot to this class.\nMaterials fee of 15$ will supply fabric and 
 batting to students.\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Classroom\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Arts & Crafts, Home & Garden
