DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260708T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260708T193000
DTSTAMP:20260618T004625
CREATED:20260609T215819Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260609T215819Z
UID:10007619-1783535400-1783539000@montclairfoundation.org
SUMMARY:Creating with Nature: Rock Painting
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, July 8\, 6:30 PM – 7:30 PM \nFind your calm one brushstroke at a time.  Using natural stones as tiny canvases\, we’ll explore simple painting techniques and the joy of painting without any pressure for perfection.  Come relax and turn ordinary rocks into meaningful little works of art while taking time to reflect and reconnect with ourselves.  No artistic experience needed – just an open mind and desire to play. \nFee: \nIndividual Class: $12 Members / $17 General Public \nPre Registration is required.  There are no drop-ins for this class. \nRegistration Link coming soon!
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/creating-with-nature-rock-painting/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes,Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2022/04/default.jpg
END:VEVENT
