X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Montclairfoundation Calendar Of Events": "https://montclairfoundation.org/event/mindfulness-in-the-garden/2026-07-14/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:montclairfoundation_calendar_of_events
X-SOURCE:Montclair Foundation
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260714T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260714T103000
DTSTAMP:20260618T004625
CREATED:20260609T214848Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260615T195225Z
UID:10007562-1784021400-1784025000@montclairfoundation.org
SUMMARY:Mindfulness in the Garden
DESCRIPTION:Mindfulness in the Garden  \nTuesdays\, July 7\, 14\, 21 & 28\, 9:30 AM – 10:30 AM \nInstructor: Jodi Brooks \nDiscover how a mindfulness practice can help us awaken and  live in harmony with oneself and with the natural world. This class will include: simple instructions for getting started with a formal mindfulness practice\, very gentle stretching & breathwork\, and an outdoor contemplative garden walk. This is a practice of slowing down\, cultivating quiet and paying attention to our senses. All levels are welcome. No experience needed. Class will be held outdoors. Class may be cancelled due to weather if no indoor space is available. \nFee:   \nSeries Rate (includes 4 classes): $60 Members / $80 General Public \nIndividual Class: $15 Members / $20 General Public \nPre Registration is required.  There are no drop-ins for this class. \n \nlink coming soon
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/mindfulness-in-the-garden/2026-07-14/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes,Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2026/06/Mindfulness-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Montclairfoundation Calendar Of Events": "https://montclairfoundation.org/event/outdoor-adventures-lifecycles/"}
