X-SOURCE:Montclair Foundation
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260714T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260714T120000
DTSTAMP:20260618T004625
CREATED:20260609T202513Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260612T163945Z
UID:10007552-1784023200-1784030400@montclairfoundation.org
SUMMARY:Outdoor Adventures - Lifecycles
DESCRIPTION:Outdoor Adventures  \nTuesdays\, 10:00 am – 12:00 pm \nJuly 14 – Lifecycles  \nAugust 4 –  Growing in the Garden \nJoin us in the gardens as you and your family explore and learn about the outdoor world through crafts\, scavenger hunts\, activity sheets and displays. Each program will focus on a specific theme\, and our Van Vleck Education team will guide your family through this interactive learning experience. This program is entirely outdoors\, weather dependent. Registration is required and includes everything you need to participate in the program. Designed for children ages 4 -11 but all are welcome. \nFee: FREE for Members of Van Vleck; $15 per family  for  General Public \nRegistration required by 1 day prior to each class. \n \n  \n 
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/outdoor-adventures-lifecycles/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes,Children,Family
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2022/08/swallowtail-butterfly-2-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
